==Powers and Abilities==
<gallery type="slideshow">
CF (433).png|Long Prehensile Tongue
CF (432).png|Strong Tongue
VM (291).png|Sticky Tongue
BIM (386).png|Enhanced Jumping
BIM (455).png|Enhanced Strength
BIM (396).png|Chest Inflation
</gallery>
Bullfrag has powerful jumping abilities and is very agile, much like an ordinary [[Earth (Classic)|Earth]] frog.

Bullfrag has impressive hand-to-hand combat abilities, as he was able to take down [[Empress Attea]] and a squadron of average [[Incursean (Classic)|Incursean]]s<ref name="TFoWP2">''[[The Frogs of War: Part 2]]''</ref> and hold his own against a mob of [[Squid Monster]]s.<ref name="BIM" /> 

Bullfrag's physique makes him stronger than an average Incursean, he was able to carry [[Bill Gacks]] in the air without any difficulty.<ref name="BIM" />

Bullfrag is more durable than other Incurseans, as he can endure being kicked by a [[Tetramand (Classic)|Tetramand]].<ref name="Catfight" />

Bullfrag possesses a long, sticky and prehensile tongue, which he can use as a grappling line or to hit a distant target. It is also very strong, as it can smash boxes.<ref name="Catfight">''[[Catfight]]''</ref> Its tensile strength is high enough to slow down the [[Billions Tower]] sign to a near standstill after falling from the top of a skyscraper.<ref name="Vreedlemania">''[[Vreedlemania]]''</ref>

Bullfrag can inflate his chest to repel enemies and gain momentum to jump.<ref name="BIM"/>

Bullfrag is capable of withstanding the vacuum of space for a limited amount of time, as demonstrated by Empress Attea.<ref name="TT">''[[Tummy Trouble]]''</ref>

Bullfrag can hold his breath underwater for four to seven hours thanks to his respirators.{{Refn|[[:File:Incursean Underwater Breathing.png]]|group = DJW}}

==Weaknesses==
<gallery type="slideshow">
VM (301).png|Overstretched Tongue
</gallery>
Bullfrag has a very delicate nose{{Refn|[[:File:Incurseans Have Delicate Noses.PNG]]|group = DM}} and is sensitive to strong smells, such as that of a [[Methanosian]]'s swampy stench, as demonstrated with [[Empress Attea]] and many Incursean soldiers.<ref>''[[X = Ben + 2]]''</ref>

Bullfrag's tongue will hurt if it stretches too long.<ref name="Vreedlemania" />

Bullfrag requires an oxygen supply to survive. Without it, he is limited to holding his breath while in space, as demonstrated with Empress Attea.<ref name="TT" />

==History==
===Omniverse===
*Bullfrag first appeared in ''[[The Frogs of War: Part 2]]'', where he was unlocked by [[Azmuth (Classic)|Azmuth]] offscreen and infiltrated the Incursean war fleet to help [[Ben's Team (Omniverse)|his team]].
*In ''[[Bengeance is Mine]]'', Bullfrag battled some [[Squid Monster]]s and saved [[Bill Gacks]] from them.
*In ''[[Catfight]]'', [[Ben Tennyson (Classic)|Ben]] was forcibly transformed into Bullfrag four times by [[Empress Attea]], who used the [[Omnitrix Remote Control]] to do so.
*In ''[[Vreedlemania]]'', Bullfrag prevented the [[Billions Tower]] logo from harming the nearby civilians.
*In ''[[It's a Mad, Mad, Mad Ben World: Part 1]]'', Bullfrag saved some slaves from the falling drill machine with the help of [[Mr. Monkey]].
*In ''[[A New Dawn]]'', Bullfrag appeared for a short time when Ben was cycling through his aliens.

