====[[Ben 10: Omniverse 2]]====
Bullfrag is playable in the game. Before arriving on [[Earth (Classic)|Earth]], [[Ben Tennyson (Classic)|Ben]], at [[Azmuth (Classic)|Azmuth]]'s instruction, needs to acquire [[Incursean (Classic)|Incursean]] DNA for the [[Omnitrix (Omniverse)|Omnitrix]] in order to prevent the Incurseans from discovering his return from exile. To ensure capable combat prowess, Ben had to acquire a sample from larger Incurseans. Upon unlocking his new Incursean transformation, Ben tries a few names such as "Crazy Legs" and "Aquattack" before settling on Bullfrag.

