==Etymology==
Bullfrag's name is a play on "[[Wikipedia:American bullfrog|bullfrog]]", referencing his appearance, and "frag", which means to kill.

==Trivia==
*Like most other [[Incursean (Classic)|Incurseans]], Bullfrag speaks with a [[Wikipedia:Brooklyn|Brooklyn]] accent.
*Bullfrag and Perk [[Upchuck]] are the only aliens to have been manually unlocked by entering a code into an [[Omnitrix]].
**Bullfrag is also one of three aliens to have been unlocked by [[Azmuth (Classic)|Azmuth]]; the others being [[Way Big (Classic)|Way Big]] and [[Atomix]].
*Like frogs, Bullfrag makes a croaking sound after inflating his chest.
*While Bullfrag is attracted to [[Empress Attea]], the latter has a strong crush on Bullfrag as well.<ref name="TFoWP2" /><ref name="Catfight" />{{Refn|[[:File:Attea's Crush on Ben.png]]|group = MW}}  Although he thinks she is cute, he is not into her personality.{{Refn|[[:File:Bullfrag Is Not Into Attea's Personality.png]]|group = DJW}}
**[[Ben Tennyson (Classic)|Ben]] blaming the attraction on Bullfrag's DNA is similar to [[Albedo]] blaming his cravings for [[Chili Fries]] on Ben's DNA. Curiously, [[Gwen Tennyson (Classic)|Gwen]] even made a reference to the similarity, claiming that it is the excuse all boys use.<ref name="TFoWP2" />
*Bullfrag is more muscular and developed than other Incurseans because most members of the species have very poor diets. Similar to the other Omnitrix aliens, Bullfrag is an example of an optimal Incursean.{{Refn|[[:File:Nemetrix Damaging.PNG]]|group = MW}}
*Bullfrag is Ben's most handsome alien.{{Refn|[[:File:Bullfrag Handsome.png]]|group = DJW}}
*[[Derrick J. Wyatt]] came up with Bullfrag.{{Refn|[[:File:Derrick Came Up With Bullfrag and Gutrot.png]]|group = DJW}} During production, he started out looking more like a regular Incursean.{{Refn|[[:File:Bullfrag Concepts.png]]|group = ca}}{{Refn|[[:File:Bullfrag Original Idea.png]]|group = DJW}}
**The original idea for Bullfrag's sunglasses were that they were part of his disguise to hide his green eyes. However, the crew liked them so much, they decided to make the sunglasses a permanent part of his appearance.{{Refn|http://archive.is/JcKBR|group = DJW}}
*Bullfrag's voice and mannerisms are based on [[Wikipedia:Sylvester Stallone|Sylvester Stallone]].
*Bullfrag's design seems similar to Rash from ''[[Wikipedia:Battletoads|Battletoads]]'', as both were amphibian superheroes that wore sunglasses.
*Bullfrag's sunglasses greatly resemble [[w:c:gurrenlagann:Kamina|Kamina]]'s sunglasses from '''[[Wikipedia:Gurren Lagann|Gurren Lagann]]'''. However, the design is not a reference to it.{{Refn|[[:File:Bullfrag's Sunglasses Are Not a Gurren Lagann Reference.png]]|group = DJW}}
**Coincidentally, Bullfrag's sunglasses are similar to the visors of [https://tfwiki.net/wiki/Prowl_(Animated) Prowl] and [https://tfwiki.net/wiki/Soundwave_(Animated) Soundwave] from '''[[Wikipedia:Transformers Animated|Transformers Animated]]'''.

